      "title": "CPSC product testing and certification",
      "title_zh": "CPSC 产品测试与合格证要求",
      "summary": "Manufacturers and importers of products subject to a CPSC-enforced product-safety rule must determine whether a General Certificate of Conformity or Children's Product Certificate and required testing apply before distribution in the United States.",
